body:
@thatbrguy Please treat this as a phishing alert. This repository owner posted the purported login warning in an ordinary issue and mentioned you to trigger a GitHub notification email. The same account posted the same claimed IP address in another alert targeting a different user.

The “This wasn't me” button leads to an external GitHub Pages site. Do not enter a password or 2FA code, or approve a login/authorization prompted by that link. Check your account directly through [GitHub's official security log](https://github.com/settings/security-log).

The email being delivered by notifications@github.com authenticates the notification channel; it does not authenticate the security claim written by this issue's author.
